W1 slow-ack diagnostic: an artefact of the Phase 3 W1 stall attribution,
not a maintained tool. It applies only to 320b6e8 (git apply), and its
probe and sequencer edits are what that attribution ran. See README.md;
the built-in capability is issue #207.

